<title>UK: UK's Kalon buys Portugal's Flexcote.</title>
<headline>UK's Kalon buys Portugal's Flexcote.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British paint and building chemicals manufacturer Kalon Plc said on Monday it bought Portuguese paint company Flexcote.</p>
<p>Kalon, which already owned 40 percent of Flexcote, said it paid 350 million escudos cash or around 1.33 million stg for the remaining 60 percent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
